From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:39:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] W3C_XML.parse includes internal general entities declared
 in the DOCTYPE internal subset, in content and attribute values, refusing
 recursion, nesting past Entity.Limits.depth, expansion past
 Entity.Limits.expandedBytes and any reference to an external entity, which is
 never resolved (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-xml#6)

